sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Op as Operator / AI Agent<br/>(kubectl, kubeconfig)
    participant API as Kubernetes API server<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Kubelet as kubelet<br/>(probes)
    participant Gate as Preflight server<br/>8000/TCP HTTP (no TLS, no auth)
    participant VLLM as vllm serve<br/>(same container)
    participant PodA as Pod A<br/>(test server)
    participant PodB as Pod B<br/>(test client)
    participant Etcd as etcd in pod 1<br/>2379/TCP HTTP
    participant NixlCli as nixl-client Pod<br/>(benchmark.py creator)
    participant NixlSrv as nixl-server Pod<br/>5555/TCP ZMQ

    rect rgb(255, 235, 230)
    Note over Op,VLLM: Flow 1 - Preflight pause and unpause
    Op->>API: create ConfigMap + patch Deployment<br/>HTTPS, kubeconfig
    API-->>Gate: Pod starts: python3 /preflight/llm-d-preflight-checks.py && vllm serve
    Kubelet->>Gate: GET /health (or any path)<br/>HTTP, no auth
    Gate-->>Kubelet: 200 {"status":"ok"}
    Op->>API: kubectl exec curl localhost:8000/info
    API->>Gate: GET /info (loopback HTTP)
    Gate-->>Op: Diagnostics + FULL env var dump
    Op->>API: kubectl exec curl /exit (or run-tests.sh --unpause, tries 8000 then 8200)
    API->>Gate: GET /exit
    Gate->>VLLM: script exits 0 → && vllm serve starts on 8000
    end

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
    Note over Op,PodB: Flow 2 - perftest / iperf3
    Op->>API: get pods -l llm-d.ai/model (HTTPS)
    Op->>API: exec Pod A: ib_write_bw / iperf3 -s
    API->>PodA: exec stream (SPDY/WebSocket over TLS)
    Op->>API: exec Pod B: client → Pod A IP
    API->>PodB: exec stream
    PodB->>PodA: 18515+ RDMA verbs (RoCE/IB) / 5201 TCP+UDP<br/>No encryption, no auth
    PodA-->>Op: stdout → BW/latency matrices + plots
    end

    rect rgb(235, 255, 235)
    Note over Op,PodB: Flow 3 - NCCL/RCCL collectives
    Op->>API: exec all pods: install OpenMPI/nccl-tests,<br/>ssh-keygen RSA-2048, distribute pubkey, start sshd
    PodA->>PodB: mpirun over SSH 22/TCP<br/>pubkey, StrictHostKeyChecking=no
    PodA->>PodB: NCCL ranks: dynamic ports, RDMA/TCP, no encryption
    end

    rect rgb(255, 250, 220)
    Note over Op,Etcd: Flow 4 - nixlbench VRAM↔VRAM
    Op->>API: exec pods: build NIXL/UCX/etcd-cpp, start etcd on pod 1
    PodA->>Etcd: rendezvous 2379/TCP HTTP (etcd v3), no auth
    PodB->>Etcd: rendezvous 2379/TCP HTTP, no auth
    PodB->>PodA: UCX rc/tcp, ASIO 12345 + dynamic, no encryption
    end

    rect rgb(240, 235, 255)
    Note over Op,NixlSrv: Flow 5 - Legacy NIXL benchmark
    Op->>API: oc apply nixl_server/client[_roce].yaml
    NixlCli->>NixlSrv: ZMQ PAIR metadata 5555/TCP (or 8000+1000*i RoCE)<br/>via Service nixl-server, no auth
    NixlCli->>NixlSrv: NIXL READ/WRITE over UCX tcp / rc
    end
